  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| autoprefixer | devDependencies | minor | `8.1.0` -> `8.6.5` | [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>postcss/autoprefixer</summary>\n\n### [`v8.6.5`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;865)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.6.4...8.6.5)\n\n-   Do not show Grid warnings if IE was not selected.\n\n### [`v8.6.4`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;864)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.6.3...8.6.4)\n\n-   Fix `stretch` prefix in Chrome >= 46.\n\n### [`v8.6.3`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;863)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.6.2...8.6.3)\n\n-   Add warnings for unsupported Grid features.\n-   Add warnings about wrong Grid properties.\n-   Add note about `grid` option for grid properties in `autoprefixer --info`.\n\n### [`v8.6.2`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;862)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.6.1...8.6.2)\n\n-   Fix error during adding Grid prefixes in `@media` (by Evgeny Petukhov).\n\n### [`v8.6.1`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;861)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.6.0...8.6.1)\n\n-   Fix `grid-template` with media queries (by Evgeny Petukhov).\n\n### [`v8.6.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/releases/8.6.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.5.2...8.6.0)\n\n<img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/19343/40873346-2e319f4e-6667-11e8-9fe4-9fe598e9be4f.png\" alt=\"Emblem of the Grand Lodge of Massachusetts\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" align=\"right\" />\n\nAutoprefixer 8.6 brings `gap` property support and two values support for `grid-gap`/`gap`.\n\n##### Grid Gap\n\nCSSWG [renamed](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-grid/#change-2016-grid-gap) `grid-gap` property to `gap`. \n\n[@&#8203;yepninja](https://renovatebot.com/gh/yepninja) added `gap` support with 2 values support.\n\nGrid layout code bellow will work even in IE if you pass `grid: true` option to Autoprefixer:\n\n```css\n.main {\n    gap: 10px 20px;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    grid-template-areas: \"head head head\"\n                         \"nav main main\"\n                         \"nav foot foot\";\n}\n```\n\n##### Other Changes\n\n-   Add `ignoreUnknownVersions` option for [Browserslist](https://renovatebot.com/gh/browserslist/browserslist)\n\n### [`v8.5.2`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;852)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.5.1...8.5.2)\n\n-   Fix `grid-template` support wit auto row sizes (by Yury Timofeev).\n\n### [`v8.5.1`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;851)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.5.0...8.5.1)\n\n-   Remove unnecessary warning on `-webkit-fill-available`.\n\n### [`v8.5.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/releases/8.5.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.4.1...8.5.0)\n\n<img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/19343/39965215-ddeae28e-5662-11e8-85b4-7ae81a1742b0.png\" alt=\"Coat of arms of Lisbon\" width=\"200\" height=\"221\" align=\"right\" />\n\nAutoprefixer 8.5 brings `grid-gap` support and fix `radial-gradient`.\n\n##### Grid Gap\n\n[@&#8203;yepninja](https://renovatebot.com/gh/yepninja) continues his amazing work of adding CSS Grid Layout support to Autoprefixer.\n\nNow he brought `grid-gap`. It is amazing work since IE 11 has gaps support <nobr>in `-ms-` grids</nobr>.\n\nTo add `grid-gap` support for IE 11 Autoprefixer adds addition grid cells. Unfortunately, it will work only if you have `grid-template` in the same rule with `grid-gap`. We had [big discussion](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/pull/1032) with a community about these limits.\n\n```css\n.page {\n    grid-gap: 33px;\n    -ms-grid-rows: 1fr 33px minmax(100px, 1fr) 33px 2fr;\n    -ms-grid-columns: 1fr 33px 100px 33px 1fr;\n    grid-template:\n        \"head head  head\" 1fr\n        \"nav  main  main\" minmax(100px, 1fr)\n        \"nav  foot  foot\" 2fr /\n        1fr   100px 1fr;\n}\n```\n\nSet [`postcss-gap-properties`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/jonathantneal/postcss-gap-properties) before Autoprefixer if you want to use new `gap` property.\n\n##### Radial Gradients\n\nOld gradients with prefixes used a different direction syntax. Autoprefixer converts direction to old syntax (or warn you to rewrite direction from old to new syntax).\n\nBut it has an issue with extent keywords like `circle closest-corner`. We fixed it after [@&#8203;BaliBalo](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BaliBalo) [report](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/issues/1002).\n\n```css\n.mask {\n    -webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(100% 50%, circle closest-corner, black, white);\n            mask-image: radial-gradient(circle closest-corner at 100% 50%, black, white);\n}\n```\n\n### [`v8.4.1`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;841)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.4.0...8.4.1)\n\n-   Fix working in old PostCSS versions (by Diablohu).\n\n### [`v8.4.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/releases/8.4.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.3.0...8.4.0)\n\n<img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/19343/39393137-a14441ba-4a8f-11e8-90f9-c31599b5380b.jpg\" alt=\"Bludor family coat of arms\" width=\"220\" height=\"242\" align=\"right\" />\n\nAutoprefixer 8.4 brings new control comment to ignore next line.\n\n[@&#8203;vostrik](https://renovatebot.com/gh/vostrik) implemented the [@&#8203;levin-du](https://renovatebot.com/gh/levin-du)’s idea of having control comment to disable only next property/rule:\n\n```css\n.logo {\n    /* autoprefixer: ignore next */\n    user-select: none; /* ← ignored */\n    mask: url(mask.jpg); /* ← will be prefixed */\n}\n\n/* autoprefixer: ignore next */\n::placholder /* ← ignored */ {\n    text-decoration-style: dotted; /* ← will be prefixed */\n}\n```\n\n### [`v8.3.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/releases/8.3.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.2.0...8.3.0)\n\n<img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/19343/38788020-6f42dc6a-40ff-11e8-998d-07327b440c7d.png\" alt=\"Seal of the City of Pittsburgh\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\" align=\"right\" />\n\nAutoprefixer 8.3 adds `@media` support for `grid-template` and fixes gradient direction warning.\n\n##### Media and Grid Layout\n\n[@&#8203;evgeny-petukhov](https://renovatebot.com/gh/evgeny-petukhov) continues his great work for Grid Layout support in Autoprefixer.\n\nNow he improved `@media` support. Now this CSS will work in IE:\n\n```css\nbody {\n    grid-template:\n        [header-left] \"head head\" 30px [header-right]\n        [main-left]   \"nav  main\" 1fr  [main-right]\n        [footer-left] \"nav  foot\" 30px [footer-right]\n        / 120px repeat(4, 250px 10px);\n}\n\nheader {\n    grid-area: head;\n}\n\nmain {\n    grid-area: main;\n}\n\nfooter {\n    grid-area: footer;\n}\n\n@&#8203;media (min-width: 1000px) {\n    body {\n        grid-template:\n            [header-left] \"head\" 30px [header-right]\n            [main-left]   \"main\" 1fr  [main-right]\n            [footer-left] \"footer\" 30px [footer-right]\n            / 1fr;\n    }\n}\n```\n\nDon’t forget that Autoprefixer inserts Grid Layout prefixes only if you set `grid: true` option.\n\n##### Gradient Warning\n\n[@&#8203;radium-v](https://renovatebot.com/gh/radium-v) found that Autoprefixer show warning even if `cover` is outside of `radial-gradient`.\n\n```css\na {\n    background: radial-gradient(#fff, transparent) 0 0 / cover no-repeat #f0f;\n}\n```\n\n[@&#8203;kotfire](https://renovatebot.com/gh/kotfire) improve old direction detection and fix this issue.\n\n### [`v8.2.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/releases/8.2.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/postcss/autoprefixer/compare/8.1.0...8.2.0)\n\n<img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/19343/37743223-6fd271d2-2d3f-11e8-8bf7-2694c9cee7e3.png\" alt=\"The Great Seal of the State of Kansas\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" align=\"right\" />\n\nAutoprefixer 8.2 brings [`color-adjust`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-4/#color-adjust) support.\n\n[@&#8203;YozhikM](https://renovatebot.com/gh/YozhikM), [@&#8203;soul-wish](https://renovatebot.com/gh/soul-wish), and [@&#8203;yuriyalekseyev](https://renovatebot.com/gh/yuriyalekseyev) did a great work. They added new data to Can I Use and implemented a new feature to Autoprefixer.\n\n```css\nbody {\n    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;\n            color-adjust: exact;\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
